	(text "Not fitted. Separate bus on GPIO 0 and 1, address 0x50.\nJP2 open: R14 holds WP high, the chip is write-protected.\nClose JP2 to write. Values from the HAT design guide:\nR12, R13 3.9 kOhm, R14 1 kOhm (to verify)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 119.38 195.58 0)
